# The Docker build context is the repo root (images need shared/ as well as
# their own package), so keep host artefacts out of it. node_modules matters
# most: the host's native binaries (better-sqlite3) do not run on Alpine.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
docs
*.md
